WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.703
-White House Press Secretary
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.938
hasn't been holding
many press briefings lately,

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:08.908
so we decided to hold one of our
own right here, right now.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.276
That's right,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.310
and the Late Night Press Corps

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.879
are here in our studio
and ready to go.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.715
So without further ado,
it's time for the "Late Night"

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.283
White House Press Briefing.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.285
♪♪

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:25.158
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.427
Secretary Sanders!
Secretary Sanders!

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.727
Secretary Sanders.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:29.896
Secre--
Yes, thank you.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.864
Seth Meyers,
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.766
Secretary Sanders,
who do you think

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:37.537
you'll be working for
by this time next year?

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.140
-President Mike Pence.
-Oh.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.111
-What's the rarest thing
in the entire universe?

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.279
-A question
that I could answer.

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:49.481
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:52.318
-Where does Donald Trump
see himself in five years?

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.352
-Prison.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.521
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.991
-I heard -- Sarah...

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:01.294
I heard President Trump
burnt his hand pretty bad

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.328
the other day.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.663
What did he burn it on?

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:04.897
-The Bible.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:09.869
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.137
-Name someone you'd
rather have dinner with

00:01:12.137 --> 00:01:13.906
than Ivanka and Jared?

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.674
-Every single member of ISIS.

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:22.515
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.050
-Secretary Sanders,
do you believe in Hell?

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.052
-That's where we are right now.

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:27.787
[ Audience "Oohs," laughter ]

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.589
-Okay, hypothetical.

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.091
Let's say Donald Trump
was exiting Air Force One

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.661
and his pants pocket
got caught on the railing,

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.228
causing him to trip,
which, in turn,

00:01:36.228 --> 00:01:38.731
ripped his pants completely off

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.833
and jelly beans flew everywhere

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.102
as he tumbled
all the way down the stairs

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:44.637
in his tighty whiteys.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.473
If that happened,
what would be the top story

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:49.542
that night on Fox News?

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:50.810
-Hillary Clinton.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.079
[ Audience "Oohs," laughter ]

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.781
-I heard President Trump
is requesting

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.116
a ham this Thanksgiving.
Why is that?

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:59.852
-He's not happy with turkey.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:09.128
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:11.230
-Let's get serious.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.699
What does President Trump think

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.568
is the most romantic thing
to do on a first date?

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.003
-Sign an NDA.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.539
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:22.274
-What broke the chair
in the oval office?

00:02:22.274 --> 00:02:23.810
-The full weight
of the government.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.712
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.880
-Sarah, some people say
you're not cool,

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.082
you're not hip.
I know that's not true.

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:32.118
So to prove
that you're cool and hip,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.053
what is the name of the boy band
from the U.K.

00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:36.755
that Harry Styles was in?

00:02:36.755 --> 00:02:37.757
-The Wrong Direction.

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:42.528
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:47.300
-How would Yoda --
Yoda from "Star Wars" --

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.669
describe the correspondence

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:52.138
between the White House
and North Korea?

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:55.642
-Responded to Chairman Kim's
letter the President has.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:03:01.447
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.682
-Guess what.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:03.683
-Turkey butt.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.117
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:07.654
-Good one.

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:11.924
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:13.859
What does Melania
ask for at hotels

00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:15.394
when traveling with Trump?

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:16.496
-Single room.

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.364
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:22.135
-Roseanne Barr says she's
leaving her home in Hawaii

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:24.270
to go live
in Israel for a while.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.671
What will this help?

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:27.140
-The well-being
of all Hawaiians.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.475
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:34.113
-What is the core mission
of the Hanes Corporation?

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:35.682
-To brief the American people.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:40.953
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:43.156
-Secretary Sanders,
I have a policy question.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:46.492
Can vampires enter any home,

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:48.627
or do they have to wait
to be invited in?

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:50.863
-I would refer you
to Rudy Giuliani

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.264
for all questions
on that matter.

00:03:52.264 --> 00:03:54.199
-Well, looks like we're
out of time, so on behalf

00:03:54.199 --> 00:03:56.202
of the rest of the press corps,
have a great night.

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:58.938
We'll be right back
with Cynthia Nixon, everyone.

